      },
      "lineNbr": 5,
      "author": {
        "id": 6005
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-01-21T17:58:35Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "I have this question too.\n\nFrom https://github.com/golang/go/issues/30439#issuecomment-477277377, NaCl is still supported in 1.13 and 1.12.",
      "parentUuid": "5d02e589_e5d1a28b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 5,
        "startChar": 63,
        "endLine": 5,
